 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February, August to September, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw October to November at 77% and November to December at 74%. So far in 2026 March to April came in at 53% on the middle. Grid 19995 had its driest year in 1988 at 63%.</p>"}
